  "title": "Growing on the line where she started: Madison O'Neal's first five years at Tenaris",
  "summary": "For Madison O'Neal, Hot Rolling Mill Operations Specialist at Tenaris in Bay City, Texas, growth has never been about big leaps. \"It's been a big shift, but it didn't happen overnight. It's been little by little,\" she says of the last five years. In that time, she has gone from Global Trainee to Analyst, Senior Analyst and now Specialist, leading a team of 37 people on the line she first walked onto as a summer intern in 2018.",
